 "remarks": "HERE IS YOUR OPPORTUNITY TO BE PART OF ONE OF THE PREMIER COMMUNITIES OF SOUTH NORWALK! Welcome to SONO GARDENS, a highly sought-after condo association offering a unique opportunity to own in a SUPER desirable location. GATED COMMUNITY, INCOME RESTRICTED, AND 100% OWNER OCCUPIED! UNIT B7 IS READY FOR A NEW OWNER TO BRING IT BACK TO LIFE AND RESTORE IT TO ITS FORMER GLORY! This first-floor unit features an open-concept layout connecting the living room, dining area, and kitchen. Original wood floors throughout add character and charm, while the full basement provides valuable additional space with in-unit laundry and plenty of potential; additional living space, a home office, hobby area, or extra storage. This is a great opportunity for a buyer who isn't afraid of a project and can recognize the value in making a home their own.  And the location? HARD TO BEAT! Enjoy being just minutes from Historic South Norwalk, with its popular restaurants, local shops, waterfront attractions, and vibrant nightlife. Spend your weekends at Calf Pasture Beach, take a trip to the Maritime Aquarium, or explore everything the SONO district has to offer. Convenient access to transportation, shopping, and everyday amenities makes this location as practical as it is appealing. If you've been waiting for an opportunity to get into SONO Gardens and build some equity along the way, this may be the one! REACH OUT TODAY-LET'S GET YOU HOME FOR THE HOLIDAYS!",
